# The in-game hosting and joining flows, captured by
# tests/drivers/run-mmo-e2e.sh. Four of these are pure UI -- a list menu and
# two naming grids, drawn by the engine's widgets and this mod, with no map
# under them -- and the other three are text boxes over the overworld, which
# is the same composite overworld-presence.png above already is. Either way
# the rule is the file's, not the linter's, so each one is listed by name.
docs/screenshots/host-setup.png
